The coffee is very hot.
I take a sip.
It is strong.
That is exactly how I like my coffee.
Then I try the chocolate cake.
It tastes really wonderful.
Coffee and cake go perfectly together.
I take my time.
I look out of the large window.
Outside, the weather is cold and bad.
But the atmosphere here is warm and cozy.
My mobile phone is still lying on the table.
I do not want to look at the screen right now.
So I put my mobile phone away.
I pack it into my backpack.
I just sit there.
I drink my coffee and eat the cake.
This afternoon break is perfect.
I am totally relaxed.
